      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4649792603653414530, guid: 5c61a05512d094139b406bae2eb52306,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4649792603653414530, guid: 5c61a05512d094139b406bae2eb52306,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4649792603653414530, guid: 5c61a05512d094139b406bae2eb52306,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[2].texts.Array.size
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4649792603653414530, guid: 5c61a05512d094139b406bae2eb52306,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.data[0]'
      value: I am starting to see it now... senses dancing in a haze of ages... but
        slowly reforming...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4649792603653414530, guid: 5c61a05512d094139b406bae2eb52306,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.data[1]'
      value: The <color=#FF8CAB>leylines</color> you invoke... it's as if they are
        a part of me. Like nerves in flesh, I feel them reaching. All across the
        Mountain.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4649792603653414530, guid: 5c61a05512d094139b406bae2eb52306,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.data[2]'
      value: Carry the signal further, and more of my mind will surely return.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4649792603653414530, guid: 5c61a05512d094139b406bae2eb52306,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.data[3]'
      value: Our meeting is destined. The force of this ancient land, and the one
        to wield it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4649792603653414530, guid: 5c61a05512d094139b406bae2eb52306,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.data[4]'
      value: Go...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4649792603653414530, guid: 5c61a05512d094139b406bae2eb52306,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[0]'
      value: I sense a great power just ahead. It's likely what this settlement was
        built around.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4649792603653414530, guid: 5c61a05512d094139b406bae2eb52306,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[1]'
      value: Be careful.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4649792603653414530, guid: 5c61a05512d094139b406bae2eb52306,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[2]'
      value: A... home? A hearth, left empty...?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4649792603653414530, guid: 5c61a05512d094139b406bae2eb52306,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[2].texts.Array.data[0]'
      value: My mind swims...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4649792603653414530, guid: 5c61a05512d094139b406bae2eb52306,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[2].texts.Array.data[1]'
      value: A... home? A hearth, left empty...?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
